{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 15, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "就", "id": "就"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "患", "id": "患"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "紾", "id": "紾"}, {"form": "色", "id": "色"}, {"form": "輕", "id": "輕"}, {"form": "迎", "id": "迎"}, {"form": "重", "id": "重"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "食", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "食", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "食", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 1.7104138297741025, "source": "食", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 1.7104138297741025, "source": "食", "target": "輕"}, {"weight": 3.096708190893993, "source": "食", "target": "紾"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "色", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "色", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "色", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "色", "target": "輕"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "後", "target": "患"}, {"weight": 3.7898553714539385, "source": "後", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 3.096708190893993, "source": "後", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "知", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.3843902633457743, "source": "知", "target": "患"}, {"weight": 4.483002552013883, "source": "知", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 3.3843902633457743, "source": "樂", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "就", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "禮", "tar